---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../../../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../../../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import { company } from "../../../data/site";
import heroPhoto from "../../../../../../images/catalogue/chapas-cobertura-fornecimento.webp";
import metalProfiles from "../../../../../../images/catalogue/perfis-metalicos-estrutura.webp";
import logisticsPhoto from "../../../../../../images/catalogue/logistica-estrutura-metalica.webp";

const whatsappSupply = company.whatsappUri + "?text=" + encodeURIComponent(
  "Hello HMATIAS. I would like to request a supply quotation. Please find the item specification, quantity, delivery location and required timing:"
);
---
<BaseLayout title="HMATIAS Supply | Procurement and Business Supply" description="Business supply and procurement in Angola. Diamond consumables, workwear, PPE, materials and equipment sourced against verified requirements." lang="en">
  <div class="preview-bar"><span><i aria-hidden="true"></i> HMATIAS SUPPLY</span><span>PROCUREMENT · SOURCING · SUPPLY</span></div>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="supply-page">
    <section class="construction-hero supply-hero" id="home">
      <div class="construction-hero-copy">
        <nav class="construction-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/en/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Supply</span></nav>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> HMATIAS SUPPLY · PROCUREMENT</p>
        <h1>Supply,<br /><em>with precision.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">We identify supply solutions from client specifications, consult our partners and verify commercial conditions before submitting a proposal.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-light" href="#request">Request a quotation <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="text-link text-link-light" href={company.sourceAoUrl}>SOURCE AO <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        <div class="hero-meta"><span>Materials · Consumables · PPE and workwear · Equipment</span><span>Angola · regional sourcing where applicable</span></div>
      </div>
      <figure class="construction-hero-image supply-hero-image"><Image src={heroPhoto} alt="Profiled roofing sheets documented for supply enquiries" widths={[640,960,1280]} sizes="(max-width:900px) 100vw,48vw" format="webp" quality={84} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption><span>01</span> HMATIAS MATERIAL RECORD</figcaption></figure>
    </section>

    <section class="construction-intro section-pad supply-intro">
      <div class="section-kicker">01 / SUPPLY MODEL</div>
      <div class="construction-intro-content"><h2>From specification<br /><em>to proposal.</em></h2><div class="construction-intro-copy"><p>HMATIAS provides industrial supply and procurement services without holding its own stock. Each request is assessed by reference, quantity, application, destination and required timing. Availability, price, documentation and logistics are checked before a proposal is submitted.</p></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="supply-partners section-pad" id="partners">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="section-kicker">02 / SUPPLY CATEGORIES & SOURCING</div><h2>A selected<br /><em>supply offer.</em></h2></div><p>We present supply categories and sourcing channels. Availability and commercial terms are checked for each individual request.</p></div>
      <div class="supply-partner-list">
        <article class="supply-partner">
          <div class="supply-partner-index">01</div>
          <div class="supply-partner-main"><p class="supply-partner-type">DIAMOND CONSUMABLES</p><h3>SYNVOR Industrial</h3><p>Sourcing channel for Carbodiam and SAMEDIA solutions, including diamond cutting discs, drilling crowns and core-drilling systems. References and terms are checked for each request.</p><div class="supply-tags"><span>Carbodiam</span><span>SAMEDIA</span><span>Cutting discs</span><span>Drilling crowns</span></div></div>
          <div class="supply-partner-action"><a href="#request">Request catalogue and quotation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        </article>
        <article class="supply-partner">
          <div class="supply-partner-index">02</div>
          <div class="supply-partner-main"><p class="supply-partner-type">WORKWEAR & PERSONAL PROTECTION</p><h3>Evolution Safety Namibia</h3><p>Sourcing channel for professional workwear and personal protective equipment, assessed against the client's technical requirements, sizes and quantities.</p><div class="supply-tags"><span>Workwear</span><span>PPE</span><span>Specification-led sourcing</span></div></div>
          <div class="supply-partner-action"><a href="#request">Enquire about supply <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="supply-evidence section-pad" id="materials">
      <div class="portfolio-top"><div><div class="section-kicker">03 / SUPPLY RECORDS</div><h2>Materials and logistics<br /><em>in context.</em></h2></div><p>Existing HMATIAS visual records. They do not indicate current stock or availability.</p></div>
      <div class="supply-evidence-grid">
        <figure class="supply-evidence-photo"><Image src={metalProfiles} alt="Metal profiles documented for construction applications" widths={[640,960]} sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw,50vw" format="webp" quality={82}/><figcaption>Metal profiles · construction materials</figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="supply-evidence-photo"><Image src={logisticsPhoto} alt="Logistics mobilisation of metal elements" widths={[640,960]} sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw,50vw" format="webp" quality={82}/><figcaption>Logistics · material mobilisation</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="construction-request section-pad supply-request" id="request">
      <div class="construction-request-copy"><p class="section-kicker">04 / SUPPLY ENQUIRY</p><h2>Tell us what<br /><em>you need.</em></h2><p>Send the product reference or technical description, quantity, delivery location and required timing. HMATIAS will review the request and check the conditions before submitting a proposal.</p><div class="construction-request-actions"><a class="button button-light" href={company.sourceAoRfqEnUrl}>Submit a quotation request <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="construction-email-link" href={whatsappSupply} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Send via WhatsApp <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
      <aside class="construction-request-guide"><h3>Information required</h3><ul><li>Item reference, brand or description</li><li>Technical specification and application</li><li>Quantity and unit</li><li>Delivery destination and required timing</li><li>Required standards or documentation</li></ul><p>A request initiates a sourcing enquiry. It does not confirm stock, price or lead time.</p></aside>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
  <div class="preview-disclaimer">Independent technology preview. It does not replace or modify the official HMATIAS website.</div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.supply-hero-image { aspect-ratio:auto; }
.supply-hero-image img { height:auto; background:transparent; }
.supply-partners { background:var(--hm-light); }
.supply-partner-list { margin-top:48px; border-top:1px solid var(--hm-line); }
.supply-partner { display:grid; grid-template-columns:54px minmax(0,1fr) minmax(190px,.42fr); gap:25px; align-items:start; padding:30px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--hm-line); }
.supply-partner-index { color:#005aa8; font-family:var(--hm-serif); font-size:19px; }
.supply-partner-type { margin:0 0 10px; color:#005aa8; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.13em; }
.supply-partner-main h3 { margin:0 0 10px; color:var(--hm-ink); font-size:clamp(20px,2.4vw,27px); font-weight:560; letter-spacing:-.04em; }
.supply-partner-main > p:not(.supply-partner-type) { max-width:650px; margin:0; color:var(--hm-muted); font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; }
.supply-tags { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:7px; margin-top:17px; }
.supply-tags span { padding:6px 9px; color:var(--hm-muted); border:1px solid var(--hm-line); font-size:10px; }
.supply-partner-action { padding-top:29px; }
.supply-partner-action a { color:var(--hm-ink); font-size:12px; font-weight:650; text-decoration:underline; text-decoration-color:#9bb7ce; text-underline-offset:5px; }
.supply-partner-action a span { padding-left:7px; color:#005aa8; }
.supply-evidence { background:var(--hm-paper); }
.supply-evidence-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:25px; margin-top:40px; }
.supply-evidence-photo { min-width:0; margin:0; }
.supply-evidence-photo img { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; object-fit:contain; }
.supply-evidence-photo figcaption { padding-top:12px; color:var(--hm-muted); font-size:11px; }
@media(max-width:800px) {
 .supply-partner { grid-template-columns:36px minmax(0,1fr); gap:15px; }
 .supply-partner-action { grid-column:2; padding-top:0; }
}
@media(max-width:650px) {
 .supply-partner-list { margin-top:34px; }
 .supply-partner { padding:24px 0; }
 .supply-evidence-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:28px; }
 .supply-partner-main > p:not(.supply-partner-type) { font-size:14px; }
}
</style>